lucy.docs: Quick QA pass on the "greet-starter" quickstart before the onboarding update. Found three annoyances: the auth snippet mixes `REDWOOD_API_KEY` and `REDWOOD_API_TOKEN`, the JS sample still uses `client.generate()` (SDK is `createCompletion()`), and there's no PowerShell example for setting env vars.
omar.eng: Thanks — I think that came from a half-merged example. Can you paste the snippet?
lucy.docs: Sure. Current (bad) snippet:
```js
const client = new RedwoodClient({ apiKey: process.env.REDWOOD_API_KEY });
const res = await client.generate({ prompt: 'hi' });
console.log(res.text);
```
Should be something like:
```js
const client = new RedwoodClient({ token: process.env.REDWOOD_API_TOKEN });
const res = await client.createCompletion({ prompt: 'hi' });
console.log(res.output[0].text);
```
tia.devex: Also add a tiny note for Windows users: `$env:REDWOOD_API_TOKEN = '...'` (PowerShell) and a one-liner about demo tokens expiring in 24h.
omar.eng: I'll open a small docs PR to: 1) normalize env var to REDWOOD_API_TOKEN across examples, 2) swap generate -> createCompletion and adjust response access, 3) add PowerShell example, 4) add a migration blurb under "Upgrading the SDK".
qa-bot: Reminder: please include a testable snippet for CI playground (copy button) and run link-checker.
omar.eng: Good point — I'll include a testable TS snippet showing how to inject a test token in unit tests:
```ts
import { RedwoodClient } from '@redwood/inference';
const client = new RedwoodClient({ token: 'test' });
// assert outgoing header has Bearer test
```
lucy.docs: Also double-check the Dockerfile in examples/container: it pins `@redwood/inference@^1`. Bump to `^2` and update any require/import paths.
omar.eng: Will do. PR in ~15m.
merge-bot: PR opened: https://github.com/redwood-inference/docs/pull/1401 "docs(greet-starter): normalize auth env, update SDK calls, add PowerShell example" by omar.eng
tia.devex: I'll review copy for clarity once CI is green. If merged, we should update the onboarding checklist (instructors) and the quickstart changelog.
qa-bot: CI: docs build started (node 18 & 20). I'll run the quick playground smoke once it finishes.
lucy.docs: Thanks team — small changes but high impact for first-time users. :sparkles:
